                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Leaking pump, weak pressure</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Worn seals, heat, dry running</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Seal kit or pump</td>
